    "focus:cute"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小小的动物，常常很可爱："
    },
    {
     "en": "cute"
    },
    {
     "en": "The puppy is so cute!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:brave",
    "focus:brave"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "不怕危险，是勇敢的："
    },
    {
     "en": "brave"
    },
    {
     "en": "The little dog is brave."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:funny",
    "focus:funny"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "让人哈哈大笑的，是好笑的："
    },
    {
     "en": "funny"
    },
    {
     "en": "Pigs are funny."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:humorous",
    "edge:funny>humorous",
    "focus:humorous"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "会讲笑话、说话风趣的，是幽默的："
    },
    {
     "en": "humorous"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:smart",
    "focus:smart"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "脑子转得快，是聪明的："
    },
    {
     "en": "smart"
    },
    {
     "en": "Monkeys are smart."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:stupid",
    "edge:smart>stupid",
    "focus:stupid"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "聪明的反面，是笨的："
    },
    {
     "en": "stupid"
    },
    {
     "zh": "这个词有点不礼貌，可别用来说别人哦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:silly",
    "edge:stupid>silly",
    "focus:silly"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "傻乎乎的、调皮的，是"
    },
    {
     "en": "silly"
    },
    {
     "en": "Don't be silly!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:though",
    "focus:though"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最后学一个小词：不过、虽然。"
    },
    {
     "en": "though"
    },
    {
     "en": "My dog is small, though it is brave."
    },
    {
     "zh": "还记得第三十四集的 although 吗？意思差不多。"
    }
   ]
  },
